---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /index.html
bodyClass: home-page
---
<div class="home-surface">
  <section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Cold Iron Edition · Complete playtest rules</p>
      <h1 id="home-title"><span>Fantasy</span> Crux <em>2.0</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-deck">Hard choices. Fast rulings. Just enough steel between a hero and the dark.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="/rules/start-here/">Enter the rules <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="button" href="/reference/">Open table reference</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="hero-principles" aria-label="Design principles">
      <p class="stamp">Built for play</p>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>D100</dt><dd>One core roll</dd></div>
        <div><dt>1 + 1 + 1</dt><dd>Action · Move · Reaction</dd></div>
        <div><dt>100%</dt><dd>Absolute skill ceiling</dd></div>
        <div><dt>6 × 8</dt><dd>Technique · Form</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="home-start" aria-labelledby="home-start-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">A three-minute orientation</p>
      <h2 id="home-start-title">Roll under. Read the situation. Live with the consequence.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Fantasy Crux 2.0 keeps combat grounded and consequences real, while moving specialist techniques into Talents. The basic rules stay lean; Talents and Shaping decide where complexity belongs.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="chapter-directory" aria-labelledby="directory-title">
    <div class="section-rule section-rule--dark">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Contents</p>
        <h2 id="directory-title">The rules</h2>
      </div>
      <p>{{ collections.chapters | length }} chapters</p>
    </div>
    <ol>
      {% for chapter in collections.chapters %}
        <li>
          <a href="{{ chapter.url }}">
            <span class="directory-number">{{ chapter.data.order | padChapter }}</span>
            <span class="directory-copy">
              <strong>{{ chapter.data.title }}</strong>
              <small>{{ chapter.data.summary | summaryText }}</small>
            </span>
            <span class="directory-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </section>
</div>
